#: ../../../pro/reports/reports.md:52
msgid ""
"By default, xlwings Reports overwrites existing values in templates if there "
"is not enough free space for your variable. If you want your rows to "
"dynamically shift according to the height of your array, use [Frames]"
"(components_filters.md#frames-multi-column-layout)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../pro/reports/reports.md:56
msgid ""
"Unlike xlwings, xlwings Reports never writes out the index of pandas "
"DataFrames. If you need the index to appear in Excel, use `df."
